un `playwright-cli open http://localhost:3002` for the Pascal development server.\n12: - Load a saved scene. Wait for actual geometry and the active WebGPU renderer.\n13: - Run `playwright-cli screenshot --filename=screenshots/linux.png` after creating the output directory.\n14: - Inspect the image. Reject loading screens, empty grids, and blank canvases.\n15: - Report SwiftShader as CPU software rendering. Do not claim GPU hardware acceleration.\n16: - Inspect `$HOME/.local/share/omgithub-playwright/linux.json` for launch settings.\n17: - Use `playwright-cli --help` for commands and named sessions. Pass configuration only to `open`.\n18: \n19: ## Mobile browser games\n20: \n21: - Support Android and iOS phones and tablets with responsive layouts and usable touch controls.\n22: - Keep gameplay and controls visible within safe areas and avoid browser gesture conflicts.\n23: - Add tilt controls only when appropriate; offer touch alternatives and request iOS motion permission from a user gesture when needed.\n24: - Follow explicit device and control requirements in the user request."}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1795067484657,"ran":1795067484662,"completed":1795067484675}},{"type":"tool","id":"call_YaWydiSQVeOfoMFcWfOJRUaC","name":"read","executed":false,"native":{"itemId":""},"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/startup.sh","limit":200},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/startup.sh, lines 1-2\n1: #!/usr/bin/env bash\n2: set -euo pipefail"}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1795067484666,"ran":1795067484674,"completed":1795067484680}}],"snapshot":{"start":"5a50791906e57118448590d1d96d5efca82ca46c","end":"5a50791906e57118448590d1d96d5efca82ca46c","files":[]},"finish":"tool-calls","native":{"responseId":"","serviceTier":"auto"},"cost":0,"tokens":{"input":1293,"output":116,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"read":4608,"write":0}}},{"id":"msg_1f25